{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1768","id":4159322375,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p8736jkH","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1768","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1768.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1768.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1768","number":1768,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"test(kg): freeze KG-N0 compatibility and scaling baseline","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1765\n\n## Summary\n\n- freeze compact P1/P3 golden compatibility checks for active manifest identity, structural base binding, deterministic checked replay, approved/candidate readback, exact QP/MS evidence, raw-byte/stale/hash/path rejection, and zero-write replay\n- add a reproducible measurement runner and machine-readable KG-N0 baseline\n- record the compatibility surface KG-N1 must preserve and the measured bottlenecks KG-N2 must address\n\n## Exact source baseline\n\n- `origin/main`: `16749b33396dee6f7b2e8c1413fc576db17db18a`\n- tree: `41d59d3fddac21449c9995ffe34ce4e333e59f56`\n- drift from issue creation baseline: none\n\n## Exact-head blocker repairs\n\n- Raw P1/P3 corruptions still fail at the real outer custody gate.\n- Bounded test-only copies of the unchanged production runtime replace only the expected fixture pin, allowing mutated manifests to authenticate and distinctly reach P1/P3 stale-identity and stale-output-hash gates.\n- A separate bounded runtime copy changes only the release-directory fixture constant and reaches the real repository-root path-escape guard.\n- Representative approved readback pins all 2 QP and 3 MS anchors by exact tuple plus canonical digest (`QP 2004b936…`, `MS c069240d…`). The approved ProcedureInstance QP/MS ref arrays are directly equal to the selected QuestionPart anchor IDs.\n- Measurement output is rejected inside the repository, and active metrics authenticate actual output bytes rather than trusting manifest-declared sizes.\n\nNo production runtime, historical builder, semantic authority, or admitted artifact was modified.\n\n## Authenticated active releases\n\n- P1 issue `1752`, manifest SHA-256 `d3f37489ae94bf2a52a802f1329131c9c1c2dccbd8990c5d17cf038062a29882`\n- P3 issue `1731`, manifest SHA-256 `e7470901b8ebb87100fed0542ca3c07800b1359fc23d87f28b0a564a9633b2b1`\n- P1 base nodes SHA-256 `1f4ecdad194f46706a5800d9b5301338b3f2f0f9dab3168d82f2fcd8dce56f9f`\n- P1 base edges SHA-256 `10db3e427de7898e178399a7ed5ec798075993eb414e62346c5551f3ce5cf453`\n\n## Measured baseline\n\n| Measurement | P1 | P3 |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Families | 8 | 9 |\n| Producer files / LOC | 9 / 16,046 | 11 / 11,968 |\n| Focused test files / LOC | 9 / 4,873 | 11 / 3,037 |\n| `build_release` invocations | 12 | 11 |\n| Predecessor build/auth calls | 11 | 10 |\n| Unique invoked builders | 9 | 11 |\n| Checked replay wall clock | 26.274437 s | 109.834973 s |\n| Checked replay peak RSS | 226,524 KiB | 468,904 KiB |\n| Active artifacts / bytes incl. manifest | 7 / 12,332,481 | 9 / 45,398,412 |\n\nHistorical builders expose no cache counters, so hit/miss values remain explicitly `null`. The repaired focused suite measured `36.611442 s` in the recorded environment.\n\n## Historical custody proof\n\nEach profiled checked replay fingerprinted all 50 files across both P1/P3 semantic artifact roots before and after execution. SHA-256, byte length, and mtime were unchanged.\n\n```text\nhistorical_builder_modified_count = 0\nhistorical_artifact_byte_change_count = 0\nsemantic_record_state_change_count = 0\nruntime_public_response_change_count = 0\nlarge_generated_benchmark_artifact_count = 0\nremote_write_count = 0\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --test scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1765_kg_n0_golden_compatibility.test.mjs` — PASS (8/8)\n- full measurement to `/tmp/kg-n0-baseline-repair.json` — PASS; committed baseline byte-identical to temporary snapshot\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1765_kg_n0_scaling_baseline.py --check` — PASS\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1765_kg_n0_scaling_baseline.py` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — healthy, clean, synchronized\n\nFresh exact-head re-review is required before merge. Do not start #1766.","created_at":"2026-07-29T10:03:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T10:35:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T10:26:19Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T10:26:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"c68a5e8110278dcff43a3afb4380d7d646491e32","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1768/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1768/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1768/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.co